@startuml
!include business_symbols.iuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #315E57
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7A9892
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #173F39
skinparam ActorBorderColor #315E57
skinparam ActorFontColor #173F39
skinparam EntityBorderColor #315E57
skinparam EntityFontColor #173F39
hide footbox

participant "<$business_actor>\n顾客" as Customer
participant "<$business_worker>\n门店员工" as Clerk
participant "<$business_entity>\n租赁与维护管理系统" as System
participant "<$business_actor>\n第三方支付服务" as Pay

Customer -> Clerk : 提供预约号或说明现场租赁需求()
activate Clerk
Clerk -> System : 接待顾客(预约号或顾客信息、门店)
activate System
System -> System : 查找预约与顾客资料或登记现场顾客()
System -> System : 加入办理队列并记录当前环节()
System --> Clerk : 返回预约资料、队列顺序与待办状态
deactivate System
Clerk -> System : 开始办理并查询装备(租期、身体参数、技能、偏好)
activate System
System -> System : 记录开始办理时间并验证适配资料()
System -> System : 查询跨店候选装备()
System -> System : 校验租期冲突、位置、维修、安全与部件兼容()
System -> System : 生成适配建议并计算价格明细()
System --> Clerk : 返回推荐装备、适配理由、门店与价格明细
deactivate System

Clerk -> Customer : 确认装备方案(适配理由、价格、换装与归还规则)
activate Customer
Customer --> Clerk : 返回方案确认结果
deactivate Customer
Clerk -> System : 创建合同并收费(顾客、装备、租期、确认价格)
activate System
System -> System : 暂时锁定装备并生成待支付合同()
System -> System : 生成唯一支付请求并检查重复收费()
System -> Pay : 收取租赁费用(支付请求号、合同号、金额)
activate Pay
Pay --> System : 返回支付结果
deactivate Pay
System -> System : 确认合同、完成办理任务并记录审计轨迹()
System --> Clerk : 返回电子合同、支付凭证与取件信息
deactivate System
Clerk -> Customer : 交付装备、电子合同与归还说明()
activate Customer
Customer --> Clerk : 返回领取确认
deactivate Customer
deactivate Clerk

@enduml
